    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρᾱής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρος, ἄημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blowing strongly</i>, of winds, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.253
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				594
			</span></i>; <i>si</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκραὲς</span>
			<i>erit</i> if a <i>brisk breeze</i> spring up, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				10.17.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκραεί</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεῖν</span> sail <i>with fresh breeze</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				24.1
			</span></i>.</div>
